    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44975" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sphăcos</span></b> , i,
		m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφάκος</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> = sphagnos, <i>a kind of
				fragrant moss</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 24, 6, 17, §
			27</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			= elelisphacos, <i>a kind of sage</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 22,
